    "media:imagetext": "Pl\nSO\nW\nyc\nPh\nFLI\n(Z\nIt ac\nDHA JFK FC 1 / 79\nWELCOME\nWe welcome you on board our flight\nto the United States\nwith a traditional Arabic welcome of\nopen hands\nAHLAN WA SAHLAN\nHORS D'OEUVRE\nGulf Shrimps tastefully garnished\nand served with a Cocktail Sauce\nSALAD\nSeasonal Salad with a choice of Dressing\nENTREE\nROAST SIRLOIN OF BEEF\nSucculent Sirloin Roasted and carved on board\nCHICKEN VALDOSTANA\nBreast of Chicken stuffed with Gruyere\nCheese in a rich cream sauce\nHAMOUR MEUNIERE PORTUGESE\nFillets of Hamour fried in butter and\ndressed on a spicy onion and tomato Sauce\nLAMB QOZI\nSliced Leg of Lamb served on a bed of Oriental rice\nVEGETABLES\nRice - Ann Potatoes\nGreen Beans - Buttered Baby Carrots\nINTERNATIONAL CHEESE SERVICE\nOn the Cheese Board a selection of\nBlue Cheese - Gruyere - Edam - Camembert\naccompanied by an array of selected fresh fruit\nDESSERT\nChocolate Swiss Roll - Arabic Pastries\nFresh Coffee - Tea - Milk - Nescafe - Soft Drinks - Fruit Juice\nSaudia Print Shop\nsaudia\nobe 21\nl, Salicho\nDer loyal\n080.1180",
